; Thayer, see word), with subjunc., \n __1. and if: Mrk.16:18 Luk.12:38, Jhn.8:55, 1Co.13:2-3, Jas.5:15; with ellips., Luk.13:9. \n __2. Concessive, even if: Mat.21:21 26:35, Jhn.8:14 10:38 11:25, Heb.12:20. \n __3. As intensive of simple καί (M, Pr., 167; WM, 730; Jannaris, Gr., 598), even, at least: Mrk.5:28 6:56, Act.5:15, 2Co.11:16.†\n (AS)","source_line":2770}],"occurrence_count":16,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"ainda","count":3},{"gloss":"se","count":3},{"gloss":"as","count":2},{"gloss":"ao-menos","count":2},{"gloss":"se-disserdes","count":1},{"gloss":"e-se","count":1},{"gloss":"vigília","count":1},{"gloss":"e","count":1},{"gloss":"ainda-que-esteja","count":1},{"gloss":"ordenado","count":1}]},"G296":{"id":"G296","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G0296","disambiguated_id":"G0296 =","unique_id":"G0296","headword":"ἄμφοδον","transliteration":"amphodon","lexical_morphology":"G:N-N","gloss_en":"street","definition_en":"ἄμφοδον, -ου, το\n (ἀμφί ὁδός), [in LXX for אַרְמוֹן (Jer.17:27 30:10 49:27)* ;] \nprop., a road around anything (RV, the open street): Mrk.11:4, Act.19:28, WH, mg.†\n (AS)","source_line":399}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"esquina","count":1}]},"G3438":{"id":"G3438","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3438","disambiguated_id":"G3438 =","unique_id":"G3438","headword":"μονή","transliteration":"monē","lexical_morphology":"G:N-F","gloss_en":"abode","definition_en":"μονή, -ῆς, ἡ\n (μένω), [in LXX: 1Ma.7:38 * ;] \n__1. in cl., \n __(a) a staying, abiding; \n __(b) continuance (LXX, 1 with) \n __2. In late Gk., \n __(a) a statson (Paus.); \n __(b) an abode: Jhn.14:2, 23; \n __(with) a monastery (cf. MM, iii, xvi; so in MGr.).†\n (AS)","source_line":3551}],"occurrence_count":2,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"há-moradas","count":1},{"gloss":"morada","count":1}]},"G3591":{"id":"G3591","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G3591","disambiguated_id":"G3591 =","unique_id":"G3591","headword":"