Deu.4:9, Isa.40:13 (יָדַע hi.), Isa.40:14 (בִּין hi.), Da TH Dan.9:22 (שָׂכַל hi.) * ;] \n__1. to join or knit together, unite: Eph.4:16, Col.2:2 (but see infr.), Col.2:19. \n __2. to compare, consider, conclude (Plat.): Act.16:10. \n __3. to deduce, prove, demonstrate (Arist.): Act.9:22. \n __4. As in LXX (\"translation Greek,\" = ἐμβιβάζω, metaphorically), to teach, instruct: 1Co.2:16 Act.19:33, R, mg. (also in Vg., Col.2:2, instructi, but see supr.).†\n (AS)","source_line":4970}],"occurrence_count":7,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"provando","count":2},{"gloss":"concluindo","count":1},{"gloss":"instruir","count":1},{"gloss":"unido","count":1},{"gloss":"unidos","count":1},{"gloss":"ligamentos","count":1}]},"G4882":{"id":"G4882","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G4882","disambiguated_id":"G4882 =","unique_id":"G4882","headword":"συναποστέλλω","transliteration":"sunapostellō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to send with","definition_en":"συν-απο-στέλλω \n [in LXX: Exo.33:2, 12 (שָׁלַח), I Est.5:2 * ;] \nto send along with: with accusative, 2Co.12:18 (cf. MM, xxiv).†\n (AS)","source_line":5034}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"enviei","count":1}]},"G496":{"id":"G496","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G0496","disambiguated_id":"G0496 =","unique_id":"G0496","headword":"ἀντιπίπτω","transliteration":"antipiptō","lexical_morphology":"G:V","gloss_en":"to resist","definition_en":"ἀντι-πίπτω \n [in LXX: Exo.26:5 (קָבַל), Exo.26:17 (שׁוּב), Num.27:14 (מְרִיבָה) Job.23:13 (שָׁלַב hi.) * ;] \n__1. to fall against or upon (Arist., Polyb.). \n __2. to strive against, resist (Arist.): with dative, Act.7:51 \n (AS)","source_line":604}],"occurrence_count":1,"observed_portuguese_glosses":[{"gloss":"tal","count":1}]},"G5031":{"id":"G5031","source":"TBESG","entries":[{"source_id":"G5031","disambiguated_id":"G5031 =","unique_id":"G5031","headword":"ταχινός","transliteration":"tachinos","lexical_morphology":"G:A","gloss_en":"q